    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Barrel baller is a 3D platformer where you take control of v806 autonomous hauler unit across different planets.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/f0de21124c79e1e23691553c08b9ec5e.avif?t=1738418735\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>v806 autonomous hauler unit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of hauler unit developed to work in any environmental condition be it on planets or in space, with enormous carrying capacity you can carry any cargo you find\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/4294b065d0614cef2a7699c9ad05dddb.avif?t=1738418735\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/b1aa6a8741fdacc25864de019d556c14.avif?t=1738418735\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environment</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different environments varying across different levels, what will those levels unveil\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/0bf575a721dd6a7574b47c71ace1ce77.avif?t=1738418735\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 different animations for your mech</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/fa99414ae658d056c1d0ce3661987ec1.avif?t=1738418735\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 10 different presets for your mech</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/9bbe4c19582df4584494c9a9fd164793.poster.avif?t=1738418735\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/9bbe4c19582df4584494c9a9fd164793.webm?t=1738418735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Barrel baller is a 3D platformer where you take control of v806 autonomous hauler unit across different planets.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/f0de21124c79e1e23691553c08b9ec5e.avif?t=1738418735\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>v806 autonomous hauler unit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of hauler unit developed to work in any environmental condition be it on planets or in space, with enormous carrying capacity you can carry any cargo you find\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/4294b065d0614cef2a7699c9ad05dddb.avif?t=1738418735\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/b1aa6a8741fdacc25864de019d556c14.avif?t=1738418735\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environment</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different environments varying across different levels, what will those levels unveil\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/0bf575a721dd6a7574b47c71ace1ce77.avif?t=1738418735\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 different animations for your mech</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/fa99414ae658d056c1d0ce3661987ec1.avif?t=1738418735\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 10 different presets for your mech</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/9bbe4c19582df4584494c9a9fd164793.poster.avif?t=1738418735\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348770/extras/9bbe4c19582df4584494c9a9fd164793.webm?t=1738418735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
